+/*
+ * The surfaceless display is one per process (eglGetPlatformDisplay returns the same handle every time), and
+ * eglInitialize/eglTerminate do not count: terminate it while another camera streams and that one loses its GPU.
+ * The streams using it are counted here and the last one to stop terminates it.
